     1559           f-rvs-measure-qnty
     1560           f-rvs-measure-cli-qnty
     1561           f-rvs-state-density
     1562           f-rvs-state-measure-qnty
     1563           f-rvs-state-measure-cli-qnty
     1564           in frame f-doc-pl
     1565           .
     1566       end.
